            "notes": "A big strength of Pharah is the insane mobility. We want to play around this in the first rounds, going  [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a) into  [Fuel Depot](item_3d9df063-c63e-4048-b77b-de33da05806a) to prevent dying and get as much money as possible. \n\nBuy  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) , and get either  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) or  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) if against heroes that can poke you out easily.",
