            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:53:31.99602+00:00",
            "notes": "Pick up  [Fuel Depot](item_3d9df063-c63e-4048-b77b-de33da05806a) if you've chosen  [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a) in round 1 and vice versa. This will help us stay in the air for longer and be a consistent threat on off-angles.\n\nNow you have 2 paths:\n\n1) Enough money for  [Blast Enhancer](item_02ca537d-0885-4b71-839c-6982ec5137dd) :\nBuy this. It will increase your damage heavily and allow you to almost 1-shot squishies with a Mercy pocket. You can sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and/or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to purchase this and it WILL be good.\n\n2) Not enough money for  [Blast Enhancer](item_02ca537d-0885-4b71-839c-6982ec5137dd) :\nKeep your items from round 1 and purchase  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) .",
