            "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:53:31.99602+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is where things get very scary for your enemies. If you are rich enough, pick up  [Precision Targeting](item_13a91b39-de41-4550-9eb1-9a2ebadac940) . With this, you will have to reload SIGNIFICANTLY less which increases your damage output and dueling potential by tons.\n\nIf you can't afford  [Precision Targeting](item_13a91b39-de41-4550-9eb1-9a2ebadac940) yet, just stack weapon power with items like  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or   [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)",
