            "created_at": "2025-08-27T09:53:31.99602+00:00",
            "notes": "By round 4 you should be ridiculously rich, earning up to 20k per round. Time to go all in on damage with perks like  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) ,  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) .\n\nHitscan DPS are killing you? Go a tankier route!\n\n [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) are a good combo to take less damage from  [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) ,  [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b) and  [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) .\n [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) works very well against  [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) , but not that well against  [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b) and  [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) .\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) can help you build Overhealth before going for your engage.",
